## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-06. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Genius Wand, Feather of Heaven, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal, Winter Crown
- Core: Genius Wand, Feather of Heaven, Divine Glaive
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Blood Wings over Winter Crown when Use when your team has reliable setup and you can spend the final slot on shielded chase instead of stasis.; Glowing Wand over Holy Crystal when Use when enemy sustain or shield supports are keeping the first target alive through your enhanced combo.; Concentrated Energy over Holy Crystal when Use when fights are extended and you need repeated magic-damage trades instead of one heavier burst window.; Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use against drafts where early crowd control decides whether you can finish the enhanced skill cycle.
- Total cost: 11600 gold

Default jungle setup built for fast magic-penetration pressure, enhanced-skill burst, and safer objective fights after the first three items.

### EXP Burst Skirmisher (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Genius Wand, Feather of Heaven, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal, Winter Crown
- Core: Genius Wand, Feather of Heaven, Starlium Scythe
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Execute
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the lane matchup lacks hard crowd control and early penetration lets you threaten level-three all-ins.; Divine Glaive over Holy Crystal when Use when enemy EXP, roam, or jungle front liners buy Magic Defense before your fourth item.; Oracle over Winter Crown when Use when you are front-lining longer skirmishes and Julian's lifesteal stacks matter more than a stasis reset.; Immortality over Winter Crown when Use in late objective fights where a revive gives more value than surviving one focused burst window.
- Total cost: 11860 gold

EXP setup for short side-lane trades where Julian needs enough toughness to start fights and enough burst to punish low-health exits.

### Mid Pickoff (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Genius Wand, Lightning Truncheon, Feather of Heaven, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Genius Wand, Lightning Truncheon, Feather of Heaven
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use against assassins or dive fighters who can force Julian to spend Enhanced Sword defensively.; Holy Crystal over Blood Wings when Use when your roam provides reliable lockdown and you can commit to maximum pickoff damage.; Glowing Wand over Lightning Truncheon when Use when anti-heal is mandatory and your team already has enough poke before Turtle or Lord setups.; Concentrated Energy over Blood Wings when Use when mid fights turn into repeated river skirmishes instead of one clean engage.
- Total cost: 11040 gold

Mid-lane setup for pickoff drafts that want Julian rotating with waveclear, poke pressure, and Flicker reach before objectives.

